299
00:16:14,990 --> 00:16:18,910
No, no, no, I got it.

300
00:16:18,920 --> 00:16:21,400
No, yeah, yeah, he's got it, and that's not surprising.

301
00:16:21,410 --> 00:16:23,220
This is something I long ago came to

302
00:16:23,230 --> 00:16:25,570
Peace with in my role as the beta male.

303
00:16:28,130 --> 00:16:29,570
Open it.

304
00:16:35,950 --> 00:16:38,920
- Oh, my god, are you okay? - no, I'm not.

305
